# Cloudflare Workers static-assets headers.
#
# The app shell (index.html, served for every SPA route) must always be
# revalidated so a new deploy is picked up on the next load — otherwise the
# browser keeps an old index.html that references a stale JS bundle and the UI
# looks unchanged after a release. The content-hashed bundles under /assets are
# immutable, so they stay long-cached (fast) and safe (the hash changes on any
# change).

/*
  Cache-Control: no-cache

/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
